1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,196
Logging food is why people quit.

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:05,685
Onboarding captures what BMR needs.

3
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:07,748
Log a meal from a photo.

4
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:11,872
Gemini reads the photo.

5
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:16,692
It drafts items and nutrition.
Fix a portion, totals update.

6
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:19,068
Pick the meal, then save.

7
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,521
Budget updates. Eight hundred
eaten, a thousand left.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,366
A photo of the scale.

9
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,507
Confirm the reading, then save.

10
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:34,870
Reports chart weight against
calories in and burnt.

11
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,196
I built it end to end.
